{"id":"vod_md_3848","vodId":"3848","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"高达创战者TRY","name_cn":"高达创战者TRY","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"25集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230831-1/b96ecb51a3ba0a6616af435fba1226ee.jpg"},"summary":"故事开端为第一季故事的七年之后。高达模型对战的规则被革新，亦令其对战更受欢迎。虽然伊织诚和岭司得到第7回敢达模型对战世界大赛的冠军，也令学校圣凤学园沾光不少。不过，其“高达模型对战部”就只剩下部长—国中部3年级学生·星野文奈一人。在新比赛规则底下，如果要参加比赛必须以3人1组的参与战斗。而圣凤学园高达模型对战部郤因为人数不足的情况下难以出场。在偶然的之间，出现了一名转校生，就是跟随师傅修行多年次元霸王流拳法的神木世界。之后，被称为天才高达模型创制家的高坂祐马也加入。终于，星野文奈、神木世界、高坂祐马三人组成了Team·Try·fighters，能够在高达模型对战大赛中登场，向世界大赛展开挑战。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-08-31 08:18:12","playable":true,"episodeCount":25,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230829/jXNlkTXC/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230829/W2Ejafch/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230829/tVLvkKF6/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230829/eqiCBxVC/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230829/sMML9cv2/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230829/EpUG6r2H/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230829/zDge7Kuj/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230829/yQvfnki8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230829/mgExLUXL/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230829/L6epFwbE/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230829/QD2xQXaN/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230829/d7Zih1kJ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230829/0ifVFHeP/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230829/d8Qk4Fs2/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230829/IPULQaU6/in